# invincible_beach authoring plan (records fixtures/padlogs/invincible_beach.padlog, --stop-at 3100; the requests below become
# its "# test=" line, TE_TEST_ACTIONS for the replay): NEW GAME on an empty card (hub_entry.plan's presses anchored on the
# GameController states), then on N. Sanity Beach the hit points set to 3 (TEST: the shining mask), the Aku Aku crate on the east
# cliff broken with a spin (its mask the third: CharacterAgent::StartInvincibility, 8 seconds), and within them a run into the
# nitro crate west of the start (TEST teleport). Retail's explosion (100) goes through the invincibility (50 or more does)
until-gstate 7 3000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 300
idle 128
hold CROSS 5
idle 295
hold UP 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
idle 247
hold DOWN 3
idle 67
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 12 2000
idle 151
hold CROSS 3
wait 30
hitpoints 3
wait 5
teleport 109.9 10.6 -49.4
wait 20
spin
wait 30
teleport -10.0 0.0 -20.0
wait 5
goto -14.8 -7.9 0.5 160
wait 120
stop
